fill=\"#d1d5db\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#9ca3af;\">Use Condition</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d1d5db\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#9ca3af;\">Review &amp; Submit</span></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:6px;padding-top:6px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:600;\">4 langkah + attribute binding</div></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4M12 8h.01\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#92400e;\">Pilih GENERAL untuk quick start ini &mdash; 3 langkah lebih sederhana</span></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Fill Step 1 \u2014 Basic Parameters",
          "desc": "Lengkapi semua field wajib di Step 1: Rule Name (nama spesifik seperti \"Transaksi Mencolok\"), Description (penjelasan logika deteksi), Risk Score (0-100), Priority (HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW), dan Active Period (jadwal aktif rule). Atur juga Cycle Indicator jika perlu pembatasan jam/hari.",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04),0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);border:1px solid #eef2f6;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef2ff,#fafafa);border-bottom:1px solid #c7d2fe;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#4f46e5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(99,102,241,0.25);flex-shrink:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">1</span></div><div><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Configure Parameters</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;margin-top:1px;\">Step 1 dari 3 &mdash; GENERAL</div></div><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:8px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:#eef2ff;color:#6366f1;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;\">Wajib diisi</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;min-width:76px;\">Rule Name</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:500;\">Transaksi Mencolok</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M6 12l4 4 8-8\"/></svg></span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;min-width:7