        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Build Detection Flow on Canvas",
          "desc": "Lanjut ke Step 2 (Build Flow). Seret node kondisi dari sidebar kiri ke canvas. Hubungkan node dengan menarik dari handle output (lingkaran) ke handle input node lain. Atur parameter setiap kondisi sesuai kebutuhan deteksi. Gunakan Auto-arrange untuk merapikan layout otomatis.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04),0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);border:1px solid #eef2f6;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f5f3ff,#fafafa);border-bottom:1px solid #ddd6fe;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#ef4444;\"></div><div style=\"width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;\"></div><div style=\"width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;\"></div></div><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Build Flow</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:8px;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:#f5f3ff;color:#7c3aed;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;font-weight:600;\">Canvas</span></div><div style=\"position:relative;min-height:180px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc 0%,#f1f5f9 100%);\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(#cbd5e1 0.4px,transparent 0.4px);background-size:12px 12px;\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;height:100%;\"><div style=\"width:64px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border-right:1px solid rgba(226,232,240,0.7);padding:6px;flex-shrink:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:6px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:5px;\">Kondisi</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><div style=\"font-size:6px;padding:3px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(99,102,241,0.1);color:#6366f1;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.15);\">LOGICAL</div><div style=\"font-size:6px;padding:3px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(16,185,129,0.08);color:#059669;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.12);\">CONTAINS</div><div style=\"font-size:6px;padding:3px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(245,158,11,0.08);color:#d97706;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.12);\">CONSTANT</div></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;padding:10px;position:relative;\"><div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(99,102,241,0.2),rgba(99,102,241,0.08));border:1.5px solid #6366f1;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#6366f1\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:800;color:#4338ca;letter-spacing:0.06em;\">START</span></div><div style=\"margin:6px 0 6px 10px;width:2px;height:24px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#6366f1,#8b5cf6);\"></div><div style=\"display:inline-block;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #8b5cf6;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(139,92,246,0.12);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-bottom:3px;\"><div style=\"width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(139,92,246,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#8b5cf6;text-transform:uppercase;\">LOGICAL</span></div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#475569;line-height:1.3;\">Amount &gt; 10jt <strong style=\"color:#0f172a;\">AND</strong> New Merchant</div></div><div style=\"margin:4px 0 4px 90px;width:2px;height:20px;background:#8b5cf6;\"></div><div style=\"display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #f59e0b;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(245,158,11,0.12);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-bottom:3px;\"><div style=\"width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(245,158,11,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\