00;color:#f59e0b;margin-top:1px;\">GENERAL</div></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#fff);border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Risk Score</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#ef4444;margin-top:1px;\">85 (HIGH)</div></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#fff);border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Status</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#22c55e;margin-top:1px;\">Active</div></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:6px;\">Komentar Audit Trail</div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;font-style:italic;\">Rule untuk deteksi transaksi mencolok dari merchant baru&hellip;</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:8px;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:9px;color:#64748b;text-align:center;font-weight:500;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Batal</div><div style=\"flex:2;padding:7px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#14b8a6,#0d9488);font-size:9px;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(20,184,166,0.25);\">Submit Scenario</div></div><div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f0fdfa;border:1px solid #99f6e4;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"><path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#0f766e;\">Rule akan muncul di Scenario Management dengan status <strong style=\"color:#0d9488;\">Active</strong> &mdash; dapat diedit, dinonaktifkan, atau dihapus</span></div></div>"
